  "releaseNotes": "v2.5.3 - SQLite Provider Release\n\nFEATURES:\n- Full SQLite support for key management persistence\n- File-based storage: Data Source=keymanagement.db\n- In-memory support for testing: Data Source=:memory:\n- Same repository pattern as EntityFramework and Npgsql providers\n- Thread-safe with DbContextFactory pattern\n\nUSE CASES:\n- Development and testing environments\n- Single-server deployments\n- Embedded applications\n- Edge computing scenarios\n\nCOMPATIBILITY:\n- Requires Feedemy.KeyManagement 2.5.3+\n- .NET 10.0\n- SQLite 3.x",
